{"product_id":"exes-and-os","title":"Exes and O's","description":"\u003cp\u003e‘The perfect book to lift your spirits’ Beth O’LearyRomance novel obsessive Tara Chen has had more than her fair share of heartbreak. Nevertheless, she is determined to keep trying and find her perfect match. The only problem? Modern dating apps have killed the classic meet-cute. So, Tara decides to revisit her exes in hopes of securing her very own trope-worthy second-chance romance.Firefighter Trevor Metcalfe will be the first to rush into a burning building but the last to rush into a relationship. Love just isn't his thing. When his new flatmate Tara enlists him to help her reconnect with her exes, he reluctantly agrees.But, the more time they spend together, the more Trevor appreciates Tara's authentic, dramatic self. Can they break the habits of a lifetime and give their spark a chance?‘Sexy and sweet with a pitch-perfect slow burn romance’ Catherine Walsh‘One of the most delicious, funny and emotional slow burns’ Cressida McLaughlin\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Lea Amy\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780241997543\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45632237961369,"sku":"2RC9780241997543","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6899932f59a1b_Exes_and_O_s_Lea_Amy.jpg?v=1754928380","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/exes-and-os","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}